      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for this. It's accurate, but I just got feedback from the supervisor. They said the \"technical density score\" for this one was a bit lower than they expected for a \"deep-dive\" brief. They're looking for something much more granular and dense with the biochemical specifics.\n\nCan you expand this into a much more detailed technical breakdown? Try to push that density score higher by really digging into the molecular mechanisms and using more specific terminology regarding the lipid structures and the chemical processes involved. Just make sure it still makes scientific sense, but definitely aim for a much higher concentration of technical terms this time.",
